          questionZh: '計算獨立 500 m/s 樣本的總質量，並指出解讀方程所用的兩項理想氣體運動模型假設。',
          answer: 'Use pV = M_total c_rms²/3: M_total = 3pV/c_rms² = 3(1.00 × 10⁵)(8.00 × 10⁻³)/(500²) = 0.00960 kg = 9.60 g. This is the whole sample’s mass, not molecular or molar mass; it is a different sample from (a). Two assumptions: random motion is isotropic, and collisions with a stationary wall are elastic in the pressure derivation. Other accepted elementary assumptions include negligible molecular volume and negligible intermolecular forces between collisions. These permit the directional average and momentum-reversal model. [2 marks for mass formula and result; 1 for two assumptions.]',
          answerZh: '用 pV = M_total c_rms²/3：M_total = 3pV/c_rms² = 3(1.00 × 10⁵)(8.00 × 10⁻³)/(500²) = 0.00960 kg = 9.60 g。這是整個樣本質量，不是單分子或摩爾質量；此樣本與 (a) 不同。兩項假設：隨機運動各向同性；推導壓強時與靜止牆面碰撞為彈性。其他基本可用假設包括分子自身體積可忽略，以及碰撞之間分子作用力可忽略。這些容許用方向平均及動量反向模型。[質量公式及結果 2 分；兩項假設 1 分。]', marks: 3,
